# Restriction checkboxes for UNO_EssentialGit_v1.tt (see Docs/Reference.md section 3).
# One of the files every Uno app needs: no table and no database, only the project settings. Run it from the Essentials menu or `codegen essentials`.
Scope=None
Stacks=Uno
EssentialsGroup=Git
Description=.gitignore: bin, obj and the editor folders
